cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, cite it as below."
title: "placelore: open historical places, served locally"
abstract: >-
  An open dataset of historical places and landmarks: coordinates, descriptions
  and Wikimedia Commons photographs, with stable identifiers and an optional
  join to Google place IDs. Built to replace per-request Places API usage for
  cultural heritage data.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Peter
    family-names: Nemec
    alias: thepeternemec
    website: "https://github.com/thepeternemec"
repository-code: "https://github.com/thepeternemec/placelore"
url: "https://github.com/thepeternemec/placelore"
license: MIT
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-21
keywords:
  - open data
  - cultural heritage
  - historical places
  - wikidata
  - wikimedia commons
  - google places
  - geospatial
references:
